  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support Measures- SADC Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;Support to SADC will enhance project management skills, including gender mainstreaming and human rights based approach HRBA in the project cycle, establish robust systems for project implementation, and ensure quality of outputs. It will tackle capacity constraints by supporting human resources and improving financial management systems to overcome budgetary limitations. Importantly, it will promote broader ownership of regional programmes through active engagement with Member States and Non-State Actors. Embracing new technologies, such as Artificial Intelligence and Data Analytics, will enhance staff agility and ensure that skills remain relevant in the digital age. Upgrading legacy ICT systems is crucial for achieving efficient administration and communication, while improving the SADC Library&apos;s structure will facilitate better access to institutional knowledge and strategic information. Additionally, creating a dynamic online Monitoring and Evaluation System will ensure continuous progress tracking and provide stakeholders with timely insights for decision-making. Emphasizing internal research capacities and fostering collaboration with regional think tanks will bolster evidence-based policymaking, advancing SADC&apos;s regional integration agenda.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
